    },
    {
      "text": "Fields around it, for now",
      "weight": 1,
      "detail": "Aerials show open fields and few neighbours today. But the plot itself is zoned residential, and the Leixlip Local Area Plan's Confey Key Development Area plans at least 1,350 homes on the grassland on Leixlip's northern edge by the railway. The open setting may not last; check the LAP map against this plot."
    },
    {
      "text": "No onward chain",
      "weight": 1,
      "detail": "Vacant and available immediately; with six months on the market, there's leverage on price."
    }
